# API Contract Rules

Backend must not implement undocumented endpoints.
Frontend must not invent undocumented endpoints.

Check:

- docs/system/API-CONTRACTS.md
- docs/app/API-IMPLEMENTATION.md for backend
- docs/app/API-USAGE.md for frontend

Any API change must update contracts, DTOs, docs, and tests.

## Required response when blocked

If an API contract is missing or unclear, do not implement backend or frontend API logic. Return:

- missing endpoint
- missing request shape
- missing response shape
- missing error cases
- affected frontend/backend files
- documentation required before implementation
